  "question": {
    "text": "The direction cosines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> of two lines are connected by the relations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the angle between the lines is"
