  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(i)<br /><br />and <math><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />i.e. either <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />If <math><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , then putting in equation (i), we get <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Direction ratios are <math><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></math> i.e. <math><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />If <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , then putting in equation (i), we get <math><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Direction ratios are <math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></math> i.e.<math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
